  data: {
    LLM: "If your partner has won a trick and it is sitting in the center, play your best cards to help them win the very next trick for a doublendwin.\n\nTrump Control: Use your small trumps to 'break' the opponent's consecutive win. If an opponent wins a trick, use a trump on the next trick even if it's unlikely to win the whole round, just to prevent them from getting two in a row.\n\nBaiting: Intentionally play a mediocre card after your team has won a trick to bait the opponent into overplaying, then counter with a high trump to secure the consecutive win.",
